            "detailed_description": "<strong> See Light</strong> -  is a first-person story driven horror game. The main character – talented submarine engineer, who with a team of researchers will searching for the World War II sunken submarine, but the depths of the Black Sea keep all kind of secrets, and the expedition can turn into a disaster at any time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Open World – explore the depths of the sea without limitation using different methods of movement; <br>    </li><li>Action – you will have to react fast and take actions immediately to keep up with dynamics of the game; <br>    </li><li>Horror - atmosphere and non-linear story will keep you in suspense until the end of the game;<br> </li><li>Survival – use resources rationally to achieve your goals; <br> </li><li>Graphics – you will find yourself at the bottom of the Black Sea due to the advanced technology of Unreal Engine 4. </li></ul>",
